{"4641980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blood Mage", "steam_appid": 4641980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Mage</strong> is a 2.5D single-player action RPG where there is no mana; every spell is fueled by your own blood. Drain your life to unleash destructive magic, control the battlefield, and overwhelm enemies. Every cast is a decision. Every victory has a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRUTAL ACTION COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in challenging, skill-based combat that rewards timing, precision, and adaptability. Combine melee attacks, blood magic, and tactical positioning to overcome monstrous foes and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/30c3f8eaba0dc3e07c19e8c24aa948c7.poster.avif?t=1781546664\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/30c3f8eaba0dc3e07c19e8c24aa948c7.webm?t=1781546664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/30c3f8eaba0dc3e07c19e8c24aa948c7.mp4?t=1781546664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER FORBIDDEN ALCHEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare ingredients, craft powerful concoctions, and experiment with dangerous combinations. Alchemy offers new ways to survive, enhance your abilities, and push beyond mortal limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD BUILT ON SACRIFICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark fantasy realm shaped by ancient secrets, forgotten knowledge, and the consequences of forbidden power. Venture through cursed ruins, desolate landscapes, and hidden places where few dare to tread.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/aaa5fbca8c4fc9b036085db3e44cdf07.poster.avif?t=1781546664\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/aaa5fbca8c4fc9b036085db3e44cdf07.webm?t=1781546664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/aaa5fbca8c4fc9b036085db3e44cdf07.mp4?t=1781546664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your own combat style through a variety of blood magic abilities, alchemical tools, and character progression options. Adapt your build to fit your preferred approach to every challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE TERRIFYING ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle corrupted creatures, ruthless warriors, and towering bosses, each demanding unique strategies and mastery of your growing arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/db30642a4af41f192de2696855a51cb5.poster.avif?t=1781546664\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/db30642a4af41f192de2696855a51cb5.webm?t=1781546664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/db30642a4af41f192de2696855a51cb5.mp4?t=1781546664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power demands sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How much of yourself are you willing to give?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Mage</strong> is a 2.5D single-player action RPG where there is no mana; every spell is fueled by your own blood. Drain your life to unleash destructive magic, control the battlefield, and overwhelm enemies. Every cast is a decision. Every victory has a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRUTAL ACTION COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in challenging, skill-based combat that rewards timing, precision, and adaptability. Combine melee attacks, blood magic, and tactical positioning to overcome monstrous foes and powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/30c3f8eaba0dc3e07c19e8c24aa948c7.poster.avif?t=1781546664\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/30c3f8eaba0dc3e07c19e8c24aa948c7.webm?t=1781546664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641980/extras/30c3f8eaba0dc3e07c19e8c24aa948c7.mp4?t=1781546664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER FORBIDDEN ALCHEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare ingredients, craft powerful concoctions, and experiment with dangerous combinations. Alchemy offers new ways to survive, enhance your abilities, and push beyond mortal limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD BUILT ON SACRIFICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dark fantasy realm shaped by ancient secrets, forgotten knowledge, and